    <author>Coach Library</author>
    <name>Mixed L06B - Climb Simulation 20 + 12</name>
    <description>Mixed - level 6 of 10, variant B. Climb Simulation 20 + 12.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 4 min @ 90%, 30 s @ 115%, 4:30 @ 90%, 30 s @ 115%, 4:30 @ 90%, 30 s @ 115%, 5:30 @ 90%, 6 min @ 55%, 3:30 @ 92%, 30 s @ 120%, 3:30 @ 92%, 30 s @ 120%, 4 min @ 92%, 7 min @ 60%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Two simulated climbs at sweet spot with 30-second surges. Settle back without losing power.

Estimated TSS: 62.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
        <tag name="Mixed"/>
        <tag name="Level 6"/>
    </tags>
